# What's tracked: code (dirreco/, cnn/, ldm/, run.py, plot.py), configs/, slurm/, docs,
# per-study figures + summaries, Max's legacy tables, and the pre-refactor code in archive/.
# Not tracked: the dataset, model weights, training runs, per-trial CSVs, job logs.
# cnn/.gitignore and ldm/.gitignore add a few rules of their own.

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Editor / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ---- Dataset: 436 MB, too big for git; see "Getting the data" in README.md ----
dataset/
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5

# ---- Model weights & checkpoints ----
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
cnn/checkpoints/
cnn/logs/*
!cnn/logs/.gitkeep

# ---- Training runs & experiment tracking ----
ldm/logs/*
!ldm/logs/.gitkeep
ldm/samples/
ldm/src/
wandb/

# ---- Results: keep figures + summary.csv / landscape.csv / config.yaml / run.log ----
# trials.csv (every per-trial estimate) is 0.1-2 MB per study and is rewritten on every rerun.
results/studies/*/logs/trials.csv
results/studies/*_custom/
results/slurm_logs/*
!results/slurm_logs/.gitkeep
# Re-plots of Max's tables: regenerate with `python plot.py legacy:<study>`
results/plots/legacy_*/

# ---- archive/: keep code, docs, audit and READMEs ----
archive/tarballs/
archive/logs/
archive/results/
archive/code/review_deliverables

# ---- Archives & job output ----
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.zip
*.out
*.err

# ---- Paper draft: lives on Overleaf (its own history) ----
overleaf/
